# Crawling Barrens, {4}: Put two +1/+1 counters on this land. Then you may have it become a 0/0 Elemental creature until end of turn.
# It's still a land. Bot1 pays with four Moxen and accepts: it has two +1/+1 counters and is a colorless 2/2
# Elemental land creature (the counters on a 0/0 base, CR 613.4b-c), it attacks Bot2 for 2 as it has been under Bot1's control since the
# turn began (turn three; it entered on turn one). In the cleanup step the effect ends (CR 514.2): it is a plain land again with
# its two counters, which stay.

